    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ANGELS X DEMONS  SOULSLIKE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/eab3cbc24adcd32256bbccbd02ef14b4.poster.avif?t=1741879591\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/eab3cbc24adcd32256bbccbd02ef14b4.webm?t=1741879591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/eab3cbc24adcd32256bbccbd02ef14b4.mp4?t=1741879591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Depths of Despair</strong> aims to combine souls-like combat  with MMO progression, skills and ability bar. The game also changes a lot depending which tree you choose, for example the Samurai will form the game into more &quot;sekiro-like&quot;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring atleast 6 skill trees with over 296 different abilities and perks combined, offering a huge amount of customization options and fun progression paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/3928e4d36724e4b5a53d530a8afcc268.poster.avif?t=1741879591\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/3928e4d36724e4b5a53d530a8afcc268.webm?t=1741879591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/3928e4d36724e4b5a53d530a8afcc268.mp4?t=1741879591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features four distinct combat styles: melee, magic, archery, and summoning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Depths of Despair</strong> tells a story of demons finally finding a way to invade Heaven. The reason for the invasion is, of course, domination, but the main motive is the blood of angels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angel blood grants god-like powers to demons and acts like a highly addictive drug. This sparks a new age of fear and horror in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the angels, Amelia, desperately goes after the captured angels in an effort to save them, one of whom is her sister. After a long and grueling ordeal in the Dungeon of Lost Souls, she finds a chosen soldier to aid her on the perilous journey.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ANGELS X DEMONS  SOULSLIKE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/eab3cbc24adcd32256bbccbd02ef14b4.poster.avif?t=1741879591\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/eab3cbc24adcd32256bbccbd02ef14b4.webm?t=1741879591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/eab3cbc24adcd32256bbccbd02ef14b4.mp4?t=1741879591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Depths of Despair</strong> aims to combine souls-like combat  with MMO progression, skills and ability bar. The game also changes a lot depending which tree you choose, for example the Samurai will form the game into more &quot;sekiro-like&quot;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring atleast 6 skill trees with over 296 different abilities and perks combined, offering a huge amount of customization options and fun progression paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/3928e4d36724e4b5a53d530a8afcc268.poster.avif?t=1741879591\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/3928e4d36724e4b5a53d530a8afcc268.webm?t=1741879591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/3928e4d36724e4b5a53d530a8afcc268.mp4?t=1741879591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features four distinct combat styles: melee, magic, archery, and summoning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Depths of Despair</strong> tells a story of demons finally finding a way to invade Heaven. The reason for the invasion is, of course, domination, but the main motive is the blood of angels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angel blood grants god-like powers to demons and acts like a highly addictive drug. This sparks a new age of fear and horror in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the angels, Amelia, desperately goes after the captured angels in an effort to save them, one of whom is her sister. After a long and grueling ordeal in the Dungeon of Lost Souls, she finds a chosen soldier to aid her on the perilous journey.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Depths of Despair is a dark fantasy action RPG with souls-like combat combined with classic MMO skills and ability bar. Your quest is to help an angel named Amelia find her sister, who has been captured by demonic entities.",
